			&lt;li&gt;How should this be tested?&lt;br/&gt;
    In JDBC interpreter add `org.apache.phoenix:phoenix-core:4.4.0-HBase-1.0` as dependency, but don&apos;t configure phoenix setting.&lt;br/&gt;
    Then try to run any sql query with any of the configured JDBC driver (like `show tables`)&lt;/li&gt;
